Why Iceberg overrides schema fields ids for nested structs. For example in my schema struct field 'LAST_TRADE_PRICE' has id 53, however in metadata json it's "id" : 49
Shema:
 Types.NestedField.optional(53, LAST_TRADE_PRICE, Types.StructType.of(
                    Types.NestedField.required(54, PRICE, Types.DoubleType.get()),
                    Types.NestedField.required(55, YIELD, Types.DoubleType.get()),
                    Types.NestedField.required(56, DISCOUNT, Types.DoubleType.get()),
                    Types.NestedField.required(57, SCORE, Types.IntegerType.get())
            )),
metadata json:
"id" : 49,
      "name" : "last_trade_price",
